## 4. Navigation Component

Exact nav structure used across all pages:

```css
.nav {
    background: #FFFFFF; padding: 0 2.75rem; height: 44px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10001;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
}
.nav-left  { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2.75rem; }
.nav-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }

.nav-logo-icon { width: 28px; height: 28px; }
.logo { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }

.nav-link {
    color: var(--text-primary); text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    padding: 0.5rem; border-radius: 4px;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; transition: color 0.2s;
}
.nav-link:hover  { color: var(--primary-green); }
.nav-link:focus  { outline: 2px solid var(--primary-green); outline-offset: 2px; }
.nav-link.active { color: var(--primary-green); font-weight: 600; }
```

At `≤768px`: hide `.nav-links` and `.user-profile-nav`; show `.hamburger`.

