## 7. Page Header & Section Headers

```css
/* Page-level header */
.page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800;
    background: var(--gradient-primary);
    -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.page-subtitle { font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }

/* Section headers */
.section-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
.section-title  { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); }
.view-all-link  { color: var(--primary-green); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.938rem;
                  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.375rem; transition: gap 0.2s; }
.view-all-link:hover { gap: 0.625rem; }
```

At `≤768px`: `.page-title` → `font-size: 2rem`.

---

## 8. Forms & Inputs

```css
.form-group  { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.input-label { display: block; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600;
               color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.input-wrapper { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; }
input, select, textarea {
    width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-primary);
    background: white; transition: border-color 0.2s;
}
input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
    outline: none; border-color: var(--primary-green);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(16,185,129,0.1);
}
/* Prevent iOS zoom — minimum 16px on mobile */
@media (max-width: 768px) { input, select, textarea { font-size: 1rem; } }
```

---

## 9. Responsive Breakpoints

| Breakpoint | Behavior |
|---|---|
| `≤768px` | Nav collapses to hamburger, single-column grids, `padding: 0 1rem` |
| `≤480px` | Single-column everything, larger tap targets, input `font-size: 1rem` |

All grids use `grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr))` with `gap: 1.5rem` as default; collapse to `1fr` at 768px.

---

## 10. Modals

```css
.modal-overlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
                 backdrop-filter: blur(4px); z-index: 10010; display: flex;
                 align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.modal { background: white; border-radius: 1.25rem;
         box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); max-width: 480px; width: 90%; }
.modal-header { padding: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }
.modal-body   { padding: 1.5rem; }
.modal-footer { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
                display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; justify-content: flex-end; }
```

Always trap focus inside open modals and close on `Escape`.

---

## 11. Status / Badge Colors

| State | Color | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| Positive / success | `var(--success)` #059669 | gains, confirmed |
| Warning | `var(--warning)` #F59E0B | pending, low balance |
| Error / negative | `var(--error)` #EF4444 | losses, failed |
| Green brand accent | `var(--primary-green)` #10B981 | CTAs, active states |
| Blue brand accent | `var(--primary-blue)` #0EA5E9 | info, secondary actions |

---

## 12. What NOT to Do

- ❌ Never use a different font family — Space Grotesk only
- ❌ Never hardcode hex colors that have a token equivalent
- ❌ Never remove `prefers-reduced-motion` or the skip link
- ❌ Never use `outline: none` without a visible replacement
- ❌ Never create a new color not in the brand palette without flagging it
- ❌ Never build a new layout pattern when an existing page already has one — copy it
- ❌ Never make button `min-height` less than 46px
